#: scenario4:scenario4_EF1A17E8_E766_4047_942C_3956E1C7BE73
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f017b78c032e10c6c01cbbf120014bb6d571852820dfb25142d2d940fe425b6b
#. default-sha256: 6a0cfe2ba21261ca890a870994497b4c1f4df6c10b71ed3a7a0b80bbcbbe4b65
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EF1A17E8_E766_4047_942C_3956E1C7BE73"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫Master, ⟪k:31⟫"
"Master... ⟪k:32⟫Please, wake up... ⟪k:33⟫Return to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫……旦那さま、⟪k:37⟫旦那さま……。⟪k:38⟫起きてくださいな……、⟪k:39⟫気をしっかりお持ち"
"になって……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_503D27F7_8B5F_43A6_939E_1AA8BB215BAB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 875bdb92f63d462da00a22a84580dbc439e8272bba89df97c72f38ab06246d2d
#. default-sha256: 470e41ad47d162393f96a10baca802429b242e751f5b09b4cefba11712983942
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_503D27F7_8B5F_43A6_939E_1AA8BB215BAB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Ahh, have you come to, Master?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……まあ……、⟪k:1⟫お気づきになられましたか？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_B6BED36E_D636_466F_9CB0_E46702883FBB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae9b17e8fd91c9d263b359882020f7b904bd99756e462c35bc8ac3f8d034de55
#. default-sha256: bc63f1858a83d0bfa314aed5a40a432b898eed512d3b2c0733d00c571f2656f1
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B6BED36E_D636_466F_9CB0_E46702883FBB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hehe... ⟪k:1⟫I apologize for sending you through the door without warning. ⟪k:2⟫It must have "
"given you quite the scare."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ふふ……、⟪k:1⟫突然扉の向こうに送ったりして、⟪k:2⟫ごめんなさい？⟪k:3⟫　さぞ驚かれたことでしょ"
"う？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_F4926009_F4AB_479C_B9E1_F997361B0A47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f2e291e25a446713ca900a488ab6d1ed089aa20efaffc65ea8fc245e5df34f0e
#. default-sha256: 51cf0d59edd8e888426a9952f70c2ef28edf146e9e5ea7be55a8b05f064776ec
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F4926009_F4AB_479C_B9E1_F997361B0A47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I beg your forgiveness. ⟪k:1⟫I heard a terrible screaming from down the stairs, and I "
"panicked."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫でも、⟪k:1⟫許してくださいまし。⟪k:2⟫階下から恐ろしい声が聞こえたものですから、⟪k:3⟫わたくし、"
"⟪k:4⟫気が急いてしまいまして……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_4829A852_0DB6_42A3_A350_3736771CD151
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1fef67674ab102cb6ae8d59c9a4a74936450d91a0a9bd72811ac0c6bb785ed51
#. default-sha256: 5c9eb5558f7ff691cb45d943d6374323898db620214174007099dcdb181f9e31
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_4829A852_0DB6_42A3_A350_3736771CD151"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You say you saw the White-Haired Girl? ⟪k:1⟫I see, so you made it into the world beyond the "
"door before me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あら、⟪k:1⟫白い髪の娘を見た――と仰るのですね？⟪k:2⟫　そうですか、⟪k:3⟫あなた様はわたくしより先"
"に、⟪k:4⟫扉の奥の世界に踏み込んでいたのですね。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_CE8E1503_DC64_4929_80B3_3ECAA6DED4C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a7b3cb5b291f64426af2e701d6fb1045dca75728662341da18a86127e23382f3
#. default-sha256: 26d77c91059016e5c67459b88553c38c24cd27347278104f27fc698f597f2801
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_CE8E1503_DC64_4929_80B3_3ECAA6DED4C2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I am deeply relieved that I was able to take your hand before losing sight of you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あなた様を見失う前に、⟪k:1⟫こうしてまた手を繋ぐことが出来て、⟪k:2⟫わたくし心底安心いたしまし"
"た。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_A89676AB_8E73_4969_BFD6_ECF5DFBA303F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ec498a0066cb02ae8e167ade55d6890e7ebbed54314a7e9a3716ce8ba5aa6f63
#. default-sha256: 82477e5a0eafdacde85b2583edab731577bf38ac94e0ade2fc01bd8954a8894b
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A89676AB_8E73_4969_BFD6_ECF5DFBA303F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I presume you have already grown familiar with the atmosphere of this time period, Master?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫さて、⟪k:1⟫旦那さま。⟪k:2⟫もう……この時代の雰囲気には、⟪k:3⟫馴染みましたか？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_DC3DF9C7_9FBF_40AE_988A_CE94D3BAA312
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7aeaccbe3899e581f9da70ee91d98d8583fc72f7efe4d8192fc879cd5e08dc77
#. default-sha256: 1bca83cbb504767eb2fe5763bdab7deb45537a84be486c98b8a8f5e9bd090139
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_DC3DF9C7_9FBF_40AE_988A_CE94D3BAA312"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If you have seen her, as you said, then you should have a basic grasp of the situation."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫もう彼女の姿を見たと仰るのならば、⟪k:1⟫状況も少しお分かりになるのではないでしょうか。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_B0DE5C00_C06F_41F7_84D9_244D3E94237F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb81db22a8fb4ae52b2101f3564394711bb65427fce799cac386f4761b602745
#. default-sha256: fb0dcedadb67fcd6efe9db87212ff18338998cc4bc7b21b6d9688c13a720aead
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B0DE5C00_C06F_41F7_84D9_244D3E94237F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was a very misfortunate girl in this era, accused of being a witch, abused and "
"persecuted. ⟪k:1⟫Her life was in constant danger."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫この時代、⟪k:1⟫彼女は不遇の身でございました。⟪k:2⟫魔女と罵られ、⟪k:3⟫その命すら危うく、⟪k:4⟫"
"他人に虐げられる毎日……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_5B14F580_3322_4667_81E2_C62F6B032F8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 235fbb5fc55d7cfe29304c0376a4867b9c52bd7e864665b196aa6575a96c6c58
#. default-sha256: 8f0e74c17158d7be9ea61c37c04fe07399f7197b93a67fac614ba14bb701a650
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_5B14F580_3322_4667_81E2_C62F6B032F8B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was, again, her appearance that brought this upon her.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That snow-white hair and "
"those ruby-red eyes⟪k:3⟫clearly differentiated her from everyone else."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫やはり、⟪k:1⟫彼女の外見がそうさせるのでしょうか？⟪k:2⟫　白い髪に、⟪k:3⟫ルビーのような赤い瞳。"
"⟪k:4⟫それは、⟪k:5⟫他人とは明らかに違いましたから。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_216105B8_88CE_4A72_8B7B_472E05F650C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02ba06887d4e579dda69d86b867087136ce1ed143cb5a8e38d7f0d1a112d23e1
#. default-sha256: 383d18c4d2a48ef2fcdf92a06b39c0e37472dd2341613481dfadba5b1dccdb70
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_216105B8_88CE_4A72_8B7B_472E05F650C8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh, and I apologize.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I neglected to mention that this door is... ⟪k:3⟫unique."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫申し遅れましたが、⟪k:1⟫この扉の奥は――⟪k:2⟫今までとは違います。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_65367644_11A3_4D7F_86E4_F52198CE1EB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 64345c92f937c0df378e7a7fc6913577c7887bfda35b09c318152e21f32a462a
#. default-sha256: f2d3a048260a349a5bf2ccc9271ff0a3f733b43ec949645400f75e78004144c9
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_65367644_11A3_4D7F_86E4_F52198CE1EB5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As for ⟪k:1⟫what⟪k:2⟫ sets it apart... ⟪k:3⟫that will be made clear as we proceed, though "
"one difference is in the time period."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫果たして何が、⟪k:1⟫というのは……後々はっきりとお分かりになるでしょうが、⟪k:2⟫まずひとつは時代"
"でございます。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_39697E4D_326A_4396_A090_794433BA31D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ec28386d59b016f455e3e477e7bf9da4589fefdf8d4f119f6d462c51ebb40911
#. default-sha256: 02e1ea8aec60ebecb4d9edda2335946908999fc1f0fc720010df4a6aeccec95a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_39697E4D_326A_4396_A090_794433BA31D1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The tales I have shown you began with that of the beautiful flaxen-haired family, followed "
"by the tale of the bloodthirsty beast, and then the tale of steel and ambition—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫今までわたくしがお見せしたお屋敷の歴史は、⟪k:1⟫美しい亜麻色の一家から始まり、⟪k:2⟫血に飢えた"
"獣の時代、⟪k:3⟫そして鉄錆に満ちた野心の時代と――"

#: scenario4:scenario4_D8B7DF58_C837_4E48_9E3D_AF6E8C6DF8CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f996b9251bb1014c52c5cf029e4a52b99603c313d2c792975a3aac8ef5e1fc34
#. default-sha256: 8fe6cb5fd9b7975d76380c33f5b23863eb9fb1eeb722a95f0e5747f750f9d7fb
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D8B7DF58_C837_4E48_9E3D_AF6E8C6DF8CE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫proceeding in chronological order."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫順々に過ぎて参りました。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_C7067907_DA0C_4EB9_8D7D_6640B2D55A9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b50a5559fbfe98ee18df6e5add60cdbfb424c005f915ee2ae4d397930bc5161
#. default-sha256: 78b05ae1930e281dae0e303b4fafbfe1965dbe76396635e6d5eec80940306d99
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C7067907_DA0C_4EB9_8D7D_6640B2D55A9B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, the door we have just entered takes us to the period now known as the Middle Ages—"
"⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫long, long before the other three tales."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫しかし――この今、⟪k:1⟫この扉の中は、⟪k:2⟫今で言う中世と呼ばれる時代。⟪k:3⟫彼らの時代よりずいぶ"
"んと前でございます。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_F51BB548_F386_48E9_8932_FEEBFC358CEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8221ea058beb2832719770832910431c2992536681cbce9f2d256882beb8d56e
#. default-sha256: 49dc65d059d042b7f4f454ba5fab1baf3a2b7343df70ae7fd164754d25f68ac5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F51BB548_F386_48E9_8932_FEEBFC358CEB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Yes, that is correct—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫this is where it all began."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ええ、⟪k:1⟫ですから――、⟪k:2⟫ここが始まりの時なのです。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_B080792D_0CD8_44B3_8B25_6D9B097B6DDA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5cc054c5a1124b476423d32dc3ee8c3d2a428315b1e829da60e0ee1aa931073f
#. default-sha256: 369d69f6ec6392c8996793e279c216d57c8ba0c9bfdfc5ad994d1b4a5d15b10d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B080792D_0CD8_44B3_8B25_6D9B097B6DDA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The mansion’s curse, the truth of the witch, and Your identity—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫all of this should "
"be made known."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫館の呪い、⟪k:1⟫魔女の真相、⟪k:2⟫そして――「あなた」様の正体。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_FD5932F4_9DF0_4A24_A415_6821C45C5F28
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 24200f8bda4fca19e79a01240a937d4ae738f9e99a38289c2922ef6b547b6807
#. default-sha256: 5190a2a15b4b04f9d0c09c9855b30b01e2ce8502f66c487378d199ffc925688a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FD5932F4_9DF0_4A24_A415_6821C45C5F28"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If, after this tale, you are still unable to reclaim your old self..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫きっと、⟪k:1⟫すべてが分かることでしょう。⟪k:2⟫……もし、⟪k:3⟫この時代を見てもあなた様がご自分を"
"取り戻さなかったら……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_7014308B_F4B1_447F_9CB7_5CA77E0FF0E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 458ead536bc75c44f854ee6849dec1fd1423ac8f6f704e0bc1dcdf777365deb7
#. default-sha256: 668833304b77909e1eedeb0aaee7c6cb5bd8bfeddfc61df967614409ae9ec243
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7014308B_F4B1_447F_9CB7_5CA77E0FF0E8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫then there is nothing more I can do."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫わたくしにはもう、⟪k:1⟫出来ることはございませんわ。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_9E0F62D7_DFFD_4981_8761_35EF94496288
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 428f54f11c06b4d1d7ee1cf65c88ab6b06035a7838cbc4351d1fbd9ca6bbb666
#. default-sha256: 0bb7543e025e3c3aebffb8f8a31b24250d580354f7715203c2df4efed878aafa
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9E0F62D7_DFFD_4981_8761_35EF94496288"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫This door contains the last tale I am able to tell you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫わたくしがあなた様にお話し出来るのは、⟪k:1⟫この扉が最後でございます。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_88E14716_86DD_462E_B6F6_C4834BBED190
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f7d99dcd643148d7aa1fd961d5364e1194d75551505124e9f1543ed7bb689a10
#. default-sha256: c4638376003e31c19403f804794b33db45fc6449623cc931e005fe17e6432e14
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_88E14716_86DD_462E_B6F6_C4834BBED190"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So I ask of you, please do not let go of my hand until it is all over."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫どうか最後まで、⟪k:1⟫わたくしの手を離さないでくださいね……？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_AC56C405_318B_451F_8F8C_D053D0AA1B11
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e088c81a17928dc9654aea30ef987c0dee744797a7e3d747b9d179bd584f2e0b
#. default-sha256: 08d742c0984f0ae4516cdca7123053c25e83bc3481d2d0278cb4ecedfe323aeb
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AC56C405_318B_451F_8F8C_D053D0AA1B11"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now then... ⟪k:1⟫let us begin a beautiful, tragic love story of two solitary souls trapped "
"in a mansion of darkness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それでは……始めていきましょう。⟪k:1⟫暗闇の屋敷に閉ざされた、⟪k:2⟫孤独な二人の――美しい悲恋の物"
"語を。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_CE1D801E_A386_4F81_80B7_82F1195D43E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ef62d9d38fab720be93dd0881b7260f04d7a6a7caf4c57431834f2a1a6dc1d1d
#. default-sha256: 9b752e05d73f921e002daa380653cdce598df27d11111c33a1602fb01fdf702a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_CE1D801E_A386_4F81_80B7_82F1195D43E0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“In that era, the mansion was a dungeon draped in darkness.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「その時代、⟪k:3⟫屋敷は暗闇に落ちた牢獄でございました」"

#: scenario4:scenario4_E35BAA66_2050_4774_B272_0FCB6FDE5585
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ada5a011c796320ffd84d852925a13fd1cb52cc9824fa5aa444b7db654e8fef2
#. default-sha256: be7e7d45190c39cb2345e1124bb1172ca70cc2bc34b19eb94afa5da629e385db
