msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I want to repay you for allowing me to stay here..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫置いていただくのですから、⟪k:4⟫何か恩返しはしないと……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_5D5AB78C_0984_436E_A62A_E3D175B98131
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fdddc1eb54ecf3503f5935aa2a4810a835c5f2de826b58caea63b30b1a20b888
#. default-sha256: 36a8fb581d9e4812e63fcdaa5f54134fbcf99ed785e99f194c9785c6f225e834
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_5D5AB78C_0984_436E_A62A_E3D175B98131"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You need not feel indebted to me.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The weight of that obligation will only turn "
"into disdain."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……恩を感じる必要はありません。⟪k:2⟫それもやがて、⟪k:3⟫恨みに変わるでしょうから。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_5989BD40_9C21_4DF3_BC15_C6D54F5A1546
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b85d18de94da9f8a8b253a1761d56b92e69e7172add50a9cbb534c458c8d942
#. default-sha256: f6d0c97573e03f1a64c6f00c40e1d1cfa8b45fed0c3ee9bc4bf489cd5c76af37
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_5989BD40_9C21_4DF3_BC15_C6D54F5A1546"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫B-⟪k:3⟫But... ⟪k:4⟫I can’t just stay here and do nothing..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……で、⟪k:3⟫でも。⟪k:4⟫何もしないまま、⟪k:5⟫過ごすのは……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_50086CCC_ABE3_4BC5_BF22_BCA61B0D64F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 94f98a243226b4eb04346ac94dd86ba67ab2da01afc8239b36857cf0dddfe13c
