msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……ただ？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_1788B948_3811_48FC_969B_EFF9781C218B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c734ab8cd1fbd64426faf287624bb1b093b6c15b6d8ea98cbd44e62b50ea9d7a
