msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...You do not enter my room.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫That is all I ask of you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫私の部屋にだけは入らないこと。⟪k:2⟫それだけは、⟪k:3⟫守ってください。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_93C197BB_AC1B_458A_8891_957752431C4C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 53c15c87007e052e7c90504c6ac159b2252ff9c4532c28b3c6612e799218ca7b
#. default-sha256: 9dd3cbdafeb86e46212886c675c55fb308e3233b9dcac477cdfaad01540a2c99
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_93C197BB_AC1B_458A_8891_957752431C4C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫…………。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_C59BA84F_5331_4567_A82E_6BA83629ACDD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf19e588223ef0b36ebede6827e5394cbf5151ced05d11582b1f9d7507db398c
#. default-sha256: 875521cff6dee79ff72c3feff55a3f8eed8a488c163816bfdfd633ab3d8dfe42
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C59BA84F_5331_4567_A82E_6BA83629ACDD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He said emotionlessly, turning away and walking off."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ミシェルは感情のない声でそう告げると、⟪k:3⟫彼女から視線を逸らし――立ち去ってしまいま"
"した。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_C5865549_F44E_4E64_96BF_CA4EC9008A78
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ef180ce685af11cfc836dfb323afc76f3a66454d24f60c6d22071287b8acd58
#. default-sha256: cd6daa9ba9079568977451b58447a159e7e50bce2a41127e34faf0fcb777c956
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C5865549_F44E_4E64_96BF_CA4EC9008A78"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Michel was not, I believe, spurning her—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫he was merely disinterested. ⟪k:3⟫He did "
"not treat her disrespectfully, nor did he seem averse to her presence."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それは、⟪k:1⟫拒絶というより無関心に近かったと思います。⟪k:2⟫邪険にするのでも、⟪k:3⟫彼女を厭う"
"のでもなく……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_EC91C502_9764_4B00_9534_C62C88A276DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48127c252a4bcdfe489f9778c79791ca55cdc0d8219aecee48aa417816bf9365
#. default-sha256: 3708703166ae4ab847a0b6132fdd4ef4f835f9a699342eb09013276ec73648ea
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EC91C502_9764_4B00_9534_C62C88A276DF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Words simply did not seem to affect him at all."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫どんな言葉を言われようとも、⟪k:1⟫心に響いていないような。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_54050BD7_BD20_4F3F_89D2_ACF387428879
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d28ec8c7f868fe85a51adbab02d11c56639dd10bd4ac8425fc8b094a255e1606
#. default-sha256: c69e007f58617ecd4324051a0fe3d42d4a30312e0e09a20f8b0d124d3077c005
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_54050BD7_BD20_4F3F_89D2_ACF387428879"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not only was the mansion a prison for his body, his body was also a prison ensnaring his "
"heart."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫館が牢獄であるというのならば、⟪k:1⟫彼の肉体もまた牢獄なのかもしれませんね。⟪k:2⟫内側に残す、"
"⟪k:3⟫心、⟪k:4⟫というものを閉ざすための。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_7D6004BB_B5C1_46B7_A5CE_1F03430A4971
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3bdb71b8e6b40d098c8f3c945831207104ae02d6fbe1c6a6a0e29a5525de322e
#. default-sha256: 99160aad201d03812d9df9c2f0975d1a7c80f16933ced21b88efb28f5b2f4822
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7D6004BB_B5C1_46B7_A5CE_1F03430A4971"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I should still do whatever I can.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（それでも……やれることは、⟪k:1⟫やらなくちゃ）"

#: scenario4:scenario4_C646BDA3_4462_4C88_B7FF_B8279C83B0D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d88c0d22e861cc78e3b6756f16fb1be13f74048fd41a9caa1fa91b3ce7eed00b
#. default-sha256: 443d31451b649d33b492c6f10726713f311e1e38723af090724b41b65d367fd2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C646BDA3_4462_4C88_B7FF_B8279C83B0D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But she did not let that get her down. ⟪k:1⟫In fact, she might have even interpreted his "
"disinterest as kindness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫しかし、⟪k:1⟫彼女はめげませんでした。⟪k:2⟫いいえ、⟪k:3⟫むしろ、⟪k:4⟫彼女にとってはミシェルの"
"無関心すら優しく思えたのかもしれません。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_13131F31_9A42_41A0_9E64_6EA53DC69456
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 70b6cbf27f2092a35272a76eee2debbe7fd41b27b0a2c3558f4f8871f4ef4e8c
#. default-sha256: 6a5322f93d1e335201eb3a035e836865d6899632d6592896a0072138937f4363
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_13131F31_9A42_41A0_9E64_6EA53DC69456"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though he was a bit standoffish, he did not attempt to cause her harm. ⟪k:1⟫He was nothing "
"like the people who had accused her of being a witch and forced her to flee for her life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ミシェルは冷たくとも、⟪k:1⟫彼女に危害を加えるわけではありません。⟪k:2⟫彼女を弾劾し追い回した"
"者たちとは明らかに違います。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_40245605_7D13_496B_AAB5_8DF61CBD11F2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80b5c818f67557bf13657cfe038d50d3dc40383e8bea60fe7b875910c8750121
#. default-sha256: f55f47f6a5bf32362ce6dd60eb2b57dd69a009ef471e432a514ea0e00cb983a1
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_40245605_7D13_496B_AAB5_8DF61CBD11F2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And she was deeply grateful for that."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女にとっては、⟪k:1⟫それはきっと、⟪k:2⟫ありがたいことだったのです。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_3C7A6950_6D50_412E_B0FA_7756486CE3C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3bcb4d34d348b4b5f1add3e44c13a5d3cd62c84f0bfcda46b3a618d2bbfa37d1
#. default-sha256: 1dc92dc2a0f7cdb1d2daff5b78cc23647d0e78d95a99887e73b6c339328e1be8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3C7A6950_6D50_412E_B0FA_7756486CE3C5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Thus began their quiet life together—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Michel, who avoided contact with others, "
"and the White-Haired Girl, who had taken a great deal of abuse from others."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫人との接触を拒むミシェルと、⟪k:2⟫人に虐げられる白い髪の娘。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_6D41E979_C176_416B_9A55_48944A13EFCE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 41ccb8ed262e16abfae72b192d7dbba3ee12485ea8090d098d61e1d2a00d24b6
#. default-sha256: d19353851b51400c7e87d6a855d7d38337bc5e82c0cbe40a73234bb922f7a8b2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6D41E979_C176_416B_9A55_48944A13EFCE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Two people who knew hardly anything about one another—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫who were too distant to "
"really be said to be living “together.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫二人の生活は、⟪k:1⟫ひっそりと静かに、⟪k:2⟫幕を開けました。⟪k:3⟫お互いのことも何も知らないま"
"ま、⟪k:4⟫同居と言うにはあまりに遠い存在のまま。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_AB6ABACB_5661_491D_B2AC_B361299E2335
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ef32d0449ddc8227e9e9f5ebca5bd92d26647890141f06d5ed12cbacbd2fa745
#. default-sha256: 7a0ce78f4457d109bedfbf5691a8c17b6591b0108f9bebb63c9969ec4483da07
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AB6ABACB_5661_491D_B2AC_B361299E2335"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Michel spent most of his day in his chambers, so they only ever saw each other occasionally, "
"and they hardly ever spoke."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ミシェルは一日のほとんどを自室で過ごしておりましたし、⟪k:1⟫たまに顔を合わせても会話などほとん"
"どありません。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_57099ACB_C553_4EC9_955F_FAA781ED6BC2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e4c4558258ba073158f7d37534063b31266ce938d69d8c6ded164b72b4220dc3
#. default-sha256: 6449c50a1a3bf39b637c6c51ea3da02958d956f97e97e43612dbde9a368f139e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_57099ACB_C553_4EC9_955F_FAA781ED6BC2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though they stayed in the same house,⟪k:1⟫they both still lived solitary lives."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫同じ場所に居ても、⟪k:1⟫それぞれが孤独に過ごしているようなものでした。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_2279AA0A_4CF2_4489_AA22_A8D2847C68CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2e504df575419462331a2d338eadc63bbedd2e694d2683eb6857436c779f2fc3
#. default-sha256: b9a7058835f52f810c7d8199581c912d053b5007639e7523ece5fcf6483ef1c5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_2279AA0A_4CF2_4489_AA22_A8D2847C68CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nonetheless, the White-Haired Girl wanted to get to know Michel better."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そうは言っても、⟪k:1⟫白い髪の娘は、⟪k:2⟫ミシェルのことをもう少し知りたいと思っていたはずで"
"す。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_6F15CC23_D3F5_4FEC_993D_333844D58D28
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b20f01e1c0dff34b9943ece3fac1f4f565ee055d5b08417a073cc6341280fe8
#. default-sha256: 52a3fe749d58fa510c16910dcc3804cdb52f08fb6e7014dffd1011345e63dae2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6F15CC23_D3F5_4FEC_993D_333844D58D28"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She wanted to know why he called himself cursed,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫なぜ彼が自分のことを呪われていると言うのか。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_BE41FC56_496B_4165_A681_048D619EEEF0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c6831b15f56d403c922edd576ac2f572ed4d6143930d1781aa34c35a099e1270
#. default-sha256: 1be97e933c0d35ade5a1c76df83c16af80b59ce71877fa4cc2a3828aad48884d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_BE41FC56_496B_4165_A681_048D619EEEF0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫why... ⟪k:1⟫he lived alone in this dark mansion,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そしてなぜ……⟪k:1⟫このような暗闇の屋敷で、⟪k:2⟫たった一人で過ごしているのか。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_56924B05_D029_4EF7_86C2_FBCF3E8ECDB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: daf04ea4fc746e4beb989fb638666bdc7bb34267cef46a4e027e1b10c8cdffeb
#. default-sha256: 844d78bdd25707f94c7ad3f82882b69b2b6ba3eeb8e27bae792ebf60e616fb69
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_56924B05_D029_4EF7_86C2_FBCF3E8ECDB0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫how many days, how many years he had spent here in solitude."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫何日、⟪k:1⟫何年、⟪k:2⟫屋敷の中で独りぼっちだったのか。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_02943C5C_88AC_4B7C_9445_C1E7DDA92F8E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8158065a7e15856297bdc4e59a30c22c513dec3f00db6c7bae8a57b53cc678e6
#. default-sha256: 3f024085b1c15b4855e2ff7b671d8c7c14afc9737f8992229f9d55da33868bec
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_02943C5C_88AC_4B7C_9445_C1E7DDA92F8E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And while she waited for the opportunity, she also started doing things around the house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫その機会を待ちながらも、⟪k:1⟫彼女は彼女で、⟪k:2⟫自分に出来ることを始めようといたしました。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_FEAE5476_5E22_4BE2_B5CE_EBB1071EF666
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b69360eb524a6dddae969e93edc6126061a5e7fdb12878d6070846a5782f184
#. default-sha256: ebe7f800cea0a86a7f5a51f0fb31ba7282dcb56ad8e085a47d3b84a3aca54fdb
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FEAE5476_5E22_4BE2_B5CE_EBB1071EF666"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The first project she set out to take care of was cleaning. ⟪k:2⟫As the windows were "
"all firmly shut, her only source of light was candles."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫彼女は手始めに、⟪k:2⟫掃除から始めました。⟪k:3⟫窓は開きそうにもありませんでしたから、"
"⟪k:4⟫光源といえば蝋燭の灯りだけ。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_E96CF4DB_B15B_4BF1_ADC2_C15D8B247304
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c685c2682c865e4e38524a34750872b1201d18ef4be900d993ee569a3c0abc9a
#. default-sha256: d9223d8845a8986e826151395fbe36a43c145ab4899d7996012c91b2c2bc0450
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E96CF4DB_B15B_4BF1_ADC2_C15D8B247304"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For whatever reason, there was a great deal of candles stored in the cellar."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫どうにも、⟪k:1⟫倉庫には蝋燭が多く残されているようなのです。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_B3569F31_3996_4693_8CB4_72193079A5B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 993dac4a4f029d6c47077546370b5168d032dd70cd545f6142649b96efa978a8
#. default-sha256: b68e7af89b23c8ae55b4f948b075d2c2c745ca34029c056347ff265d9028b3df
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B3569F31_3996_4693_8CB4_72193079A5B7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She wondered where on earth he had acquired so many, but she never found the opportunity to "
"ask him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫一体どこから仕入れてくるのか疑問に思いましたが、⟪k:1⟫それを質問する機会は中々訪れません。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_790671EB_16E3_4500_8067_C875CA673253
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5bb080c263bd3e92bc006fa6ec4e50ca21e908ab85cd0aca622ff76b8242458f
#. default-sha256: 32adf994199ada94a7f33b4c9d90e00a5eb185a635c7aa9c391c1fb4dba1b381
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_790671EB_16E3_4500_8067_C875CA673253"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was difficult to even see all the dust and cobwebs with only candlelight, and considering "
"the poor airflow through the house, she was afraid her efforts were going to be in vain."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫蝋燭の灯り程度では埃の量など碌に見えませんし、⟪k:1⟫空気の出入りすら悪い屋敷の中では、⟪k:2⟫意"
"味などほとんどないのかもしれませんが――"

#: scenario4:scenario4_73075EBA_6725_4B69_BE7A_FC90071FF6BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 079111eaf0cfb1806869ac0eea5327d2c977630f60170d2afb5ec9ac9318bc3b
#. default-sha256: 63a505307d462042658d0555c6ba51e05a1c2b05e6a79e4ce7495a449ad313fe
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_73075EBA_6725_4B69_BE7A_FC90071FF6BE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Still she persisted, sweeping and wiping things down, one room at a time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それでも彼女は、⟪k:1⟫掃き掃除やら拭き掃除やら、⟪k:2⟫地道に進めていくのです。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_A9B09618_AA36_4C3F_8C7A_ECABE6D861FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e2c03cc525f4623b41c55e49da2f12672678e7704b3a043e7156d5225411746
#. default-sha256: d6fffab1576c4ff31de8ac02fae3967b1948d88da02c198057d8db400c8f1560
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A9B09618_AA36_4C3F_8C7A_ECABE6D861FF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eventually, she made her way to the library.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The dust that had settled there was "
"much heavier than in any other room; ⟪k:3⟫with each breath, she had to fight back coughs."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫やがて辿り着いた一室は、⟪k:1⟫書庫のようでした。⟪k:2⟫埃臭さが他の部屋よりも如実で、⟪k:3⟫息を吸"
"い込んだらすぐに噎せこんでしまいそうなくらいです。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_1ED3589A_04FC_4AA7_9181_C7023BD6EA65
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac1eef84993e7ae004376d68d5545b7986e04eeabfd34abada977c2412286ecb
#. default-sha256: e1fe8dfb237e5f74cd15eb1ac180ae25df64c75a45766a1406db39f4db13d328
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1ED3589A_04FC_4AA7_9181_C7023BD6EA65"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was not a room one would normally be comfortable spending much time in, but the sight of "
"so many bulky volumes lining the shelves sent her heart aflutter with delight."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫普通なら長い時間居座りたくない場所でございますが……、⟪k:1⟫彼女はといえば、⟪k:2⟫むしろ書棚に並"
"ぶ分厚い書籍の数々に、⟪k:3⟫胸を躍らせたのです。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_AD3E8AC4_00BA_4D0A_A64F_22B99EEF6A3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da30209d69fb4ca06f8419ca71d0c753095e0cc37fdd52a88ba6064080923571
#. default-sha256: 7a778fdbcbf6773691f37b119c2e3a501b4082479e46268100850443ad22f81e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AD3E8AC4_00BA_4D0A_A64F_22B99EEF6A3D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They’re... ⟪k:1⟫books.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Incredible... ⟪k:4⟫Real books."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫これ……、⟪k:1⟫本だわ。⟪k:2⟫すごい……、⟪k:3⟫本物なのね。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_38886115_8108_4B46_86B1_0AA90E57CCA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8c4bb362a437ad7d5c4de7fb771a58cda57ea0534208dc9c1309d5cf7e67f9cf
#. default-sha256: 58867f01f3888962fd23c10962679715c50d67374d58774dd2799ad75d8ba860
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_38886115_8108_4B46_86B1_0AA90E57CCA8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl had never seen a book before. ⟪k:1⟫She had heard people describe them, "
"but that was the first time she had ever seen one for herself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ええ、⟪k:1⟫彼女は“本”というものを見たことがなかったのです。⟪k:2⟫人伝に聞いたくらいで、⟪k:3⟫実"
"物を見たのはこれが初めて。"

